+# Board-trail cross-check mapping (Act 18 §5)
+#
+# One row per originating Antonina board issue that originates Viche
+# institutional work. This is the Judiciary's *cross-check input* for the
+# board-trail completeness lens: reference data derived from Git records
+# (government/LAWS.md, records/ENACTMENT-STATUS.md, the Act 18 baseline in
+# records/bills/board-reporting-act.md), NOT a copy of board state. When the
+# Executive's generated records/board-trail/index.json (Act 18 §3.8) exists it
+# is the preferred input; this mapping is the fallback.
+#
+# Columns (TAB-separated):
+#   issue        originating board issue number
+#   work_id      bill / task identifier
+#   act          Act number for an enacted law ("-" for a draft/task)
+#   enacted_epoch epoch seconds when the underlying work was enacted/completed
+#                 (0 = not yet enacted/completed)
+#   type         law | task | draft
+#
+# issue	work_id	act	enacted_epoch	type
